{"id":"litaniae.lauretanae","title":"Litániæ Lauretanæ","category":"litaniae","section":"litaniae-approbatae","variant":"devotional","sung":false,"st":"working-edition","ad":1,"adw":2,"about":{"pl":"Litania loretańska w postaci, w jakiej modli się nią Polska: tekst rzymski z jednym wezwaniem własnym. Do tekstu poświadczonego w Enchiridion Indulgentiarum z 1952 r. Stolica Apostolska dodała Mater Ecclesiae (1980), Regina familiae (1995) oraz w 2020 r. Mater misericordiae, Mater spei i Solacium migrantium, a obok nich Polska mówi Regina Poloniae, zatwierdzone dla niej w 1920 r. Wezwanie Mater misericordiae Polska otrzymała już w 2014 r., a list z 2020 r. przeniósł je na miejsce, które zajmuje tutaj, po Mater Ecclesiae.","en":"The Litany of Loreto as Poland prays it: the Roman text with one invocation of its own. To the text attested by the 1952 Enchiridion Indulgentiarum the Holy See added Mater Ecclesiae (1980), Regina familiae (1995) and, in 2020, Mater misericordiae, Mater spei and Solacium migrantium, and beside them Poland says Regina Poloniae, approved for it in 1920. Mater misericordiae had already been granted to Poland in 2014, and the letter of 2020 moved it to the place it holds here, after Mater Ecclesiae."},"ac":{"pl":[9,10,11,12,13,7,14],"en":[9,10,11,12,13,7,14]},"seg":[{"id":"s001","type":"verse","w":[{"i":"w001","f":"Kýrie","l":"kyrie","p":",","m":47,"a":3},{"i":"w002","f":"eléison","l":"eleison","p":".","m":48}],"tr":{"pl":"Kyrie eleison.","en":"Lord, have mercy."},"tc":{"pl":[7],"en":[8]},"g":{"pl":["Panie","zmiłuj się"],"en":["Lord","have mercy"]}},{"id":"s002","type":"verse","w":[{"i":"w003","f":"Christe","l":"Christus","p":",","m":5},{"i":"w004","f":"eléison","l":"eleison","p":".","m":48}],"tr":{"pl":"Christe, eleison.","en":"Christ, have mercy."},"tc":{"pl":[7],"en":[8]},"g":{"pl":["Chryste","zmiłuj się"],"en":["Christ","have mercy"]}},{"id":"s003","type":"verse","w":[{"i":"w005","f":"Kýrie","l":"kyrie","p":",","m":47,"a":3},{"i":"w006","f":"eléi